        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xs24dxvx0ox7k9xyqz4l2CmbgMh\"><em><strong>The diagram below shows how a biofuel called ethanol is produced. Sumarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Ethanol Biofuel Production Process</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqPldEHP5oO9Eqxr2kRlefpxgtb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MppZd8j0BovChixjbYGly434gvh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Ethanol Biofuel Production Process y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về quy tr&igrave;nh sản xuất ethanol.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VcIwdcyD3obYdJxrVgZlkQwIgAb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Ethanol Biofuel Production Process với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: quy tr&igrave;nh sản xuất ethanol - từ trồng c&acirc;y - ra sản phẩm cuối c&ugrave;ng</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IFf1dMjRDok8HtxlXSUlI37OgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QZuWdhvTyoJJNVxWwVAljRgBgHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MrzndUnnAoAadPxmIwXlREiCgZT\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề process, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh đưa ra c&aacute;i nh&igrave;n tổng quan về c&aacute;c bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KDqmdbXx3oh7xSxYn23ldQt7g9b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>to&agrave;n bộ quy tr&igrave;nh c&oacute; 6 bước.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q8rDdww1Tok4xAxom8slt23QgWe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>quy tr&igrave;nh bắt đầu từ việc trồng c&acirc;y v&agrave; kết th&uacute;c bằng việc sản xuất ethanol cho c&aacute;c phương tiện giao th&ocirc;ng.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VgqmdaJAPoNTzpxe9aslxtWrgUf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch<strong> chia c&aacute;c bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh th&agrave;nh 2 phần</strong>:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VgqmdaJAPoNTzpxe9aslxtWrgUf\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X4Xed9VbtoxxABx8cPNlcBuMgWe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> 3 bước đầu của quy tr&igrave;nh</strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PC3RdyjMqo0bXZx3ZDiliGuygzd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XOCRdU80QoP68HxvYsXl5VYbggb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>c&acirc;y</strong> <strong>tận dụng năng lượng</strong> của <em>(utilize energy)</em> <strong>&aacute;nh nắng mặt trời</strong> v&agrave; <strong>carbon dioxide</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QQ3LdxdgvoPwfQxfXculuUuKgfc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>c&acirc;y</strong> được <strong>thu hoạch </strong><em>(harvested)</em><strong> </strong>bằng m&aacute;y l&agrave;m n&ocirc;ng <em>(agricultural machinery)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MsbAdV5Hjo1NMuxTbxZlZRW7g8f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>sau đ&oacute; những <strong>c&acirc;y</strong> n&agrave;y được <strong>vận chuyển</strong> đến <strong>cơ sở</strong> <strong>xử l&yacute; </strong><em>(pre-processing facilities)</em><em><strong> </strong></em>th&agrave;nh <strong>cellulose</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R1qldBVmjoSw2exeRmmlXm6Gg3e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZUj2ddWrsoEdbgxMkVclUXK6gzc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: 3 bước c&ograve;n lại của quy tr&igrave;nh</strong></span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FrHqdNdAfo8ExlxqxUyl8Wvlgfd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>cellulose</strong> được xử l&yacute; để tạo ra <strong>đường</strong>, sau đ&oacute; <strong>kết hợp</strong> <em>(combined with)</em> với <strong>microbes</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OnPLd8Zqmo77kuxLQc8lxLVCg6g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>hỗn hợp</strong> <em>(mixture)</em> n&agrave;y được xử l&yacute; để tạo ra <strong>ethanol</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mt2cdVAWTosi9xxepuelc1HpgCd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>ethanol</strong> được <strong>d&ugrave;ng</strong> cho <em>(used to power) </em>c&aacute;c <strong>phương tiện giao th&ocirc;ng</strong> kh&aacute;c nhau</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DTDTdsp2koDTEcxBK7Wl2ITHgif\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>khi c&aacute;c phương tiện n&agrave;y <strong>sử dụng ethanol</strong>, <strong>carbon dioxide </strong>được <strong>thải ra </strong>lại <em>(released)</em> để c&acirc;y sử dụng</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FWzgdtnlOoMdnrxI05MlJrs2gOd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>quy tr&igrave;nh lặp lại một lần nữa <em>(completing the cycle)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RuxRdF0GuoF09YxnotEl2yn7gbj\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TN6Fd9B0PohTNjxAWltlSG3sgUg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi muốn n&oacute;i về một v&ograve;ng sản xuất tuần ho&agrave;n th&igrave; m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng cụm <strong>\"completing the cycle\" </strong>để n&oacute;i về v&ograve;ng tuần ho&agrave;n ho&agrave;n thiện v&agrave; lặp lại nha.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BJ6PdRsSJoeHp9xWPaZlbXKVgme\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ: </strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IY0UdZPGNoyAjGxvfYUlI9VxgOc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-TrzsdZcwIo7eHnxfCXFlw9Dog0e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Carbon dioxide is released back into the atmosphere, where it becomes available for plants to use again, thus completing the cycle.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 744,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OjM6dQpRZoDM1pxi3fGlIDzGgSf\">The diagram illustrates the cyclical process of manufacturing ethanol as a biofuel, from the initial growing of plants to the final product for transportation before being emitted to the environment.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14109,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 745,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KteUdMqKIoog6xxLyDil2NYMgrb\">Overall, this is a continuous cycle where carbon dioxide is both absorbed and released throughout various stages. The process consists of six main stages, beginning with plant growth and ending with ethanol being used for different modes of transportation.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14109,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 746,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SzjLd1SUJoMtQCxe7cJl1k9Gg3d\">The process begins when plants and trees utilize energy from sunlight and carbon dioxide from the atmosphere to grow. These plants are then harvested using agricultural machinery before being transported to pre-processing facilities, where they are broken down into cellulose.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14109,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 747,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A0QzdesrzoiN84xNYFFljukFgXe\">In the following stages, the cellulose undergoes chemical processing to produce sugars, which are then fed to microbes. The resultant chemical compound is then processed to create ethanol, which is used to power various forms of transportation, including cars, trucks, and aircraft. Finally, through the combustion of of ethanol as a source of fuel, carbon dioxide is released back into the atmosphere, where it becomes available for plants to use again, thus beginning the cycle once again.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14109,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
